      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī yene mihayo ya shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau, (hū ng'wene ū Edomu).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau akatoola a bake bakwe kūfuma mu bakīma ba Kanaani, Ada, nshīke wa ng'wa Eloni Ng'hītī, na Oholibama, nshīke wa ng'wa Ana, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Zibeoni, ūmò wa Bahīvī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke ūngī wa ng'wa Esau walī Basemati, nshīke wa ng'wa Ishimaeli, n'ilūmbūye wa ng'wa Nebaioti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ada akamyalīla ū Esau Elifazi, ū Basemati ūmyala Leueli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Oholibama ūmyala Jeushi, Jalamu, na Koola. A benaba hū baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Esau abo akabyalīlwa mu Kanaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau akabosola a bake bakwe na a bitūnja bakwe na a bashīke bakwe, ī kaya yakwe ī yose; nī mitugo jakwe, nī ndimu ī jingī ījo walī ajisugile. Ūjisola nī sabo jakwe pyī ī jose ījo walī wapandīka aho alī Kanaani; hūna wisunda ūng'wīngīla ū nzunaye ū Yakobo, ūsaamīla kūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būsabi wabo būkakwīla no, yūbiza shilambu ū kwikala hamò; ī sī īyo bikalaga īkabagehela, yūbiza shilambu ū kūbigela būbīlī wabo, nguno ya būsabi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Esau (hū ū Edomu) ūja kwikala Seili, sī ya magūlya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī yene mihayo ya shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau, ū nkūlūgenji wa Baedomu, abo baalī bikaji ba mu sī ya magūlya ga Seili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būbyīle bo ng'wa Seili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basugi ba mu Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
